    "title": "FW: Assynt Report Daily Digest",
    "content": "<html><body>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\nSent from my Galaxy    <br/>\n    <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n-------- Original message --------   <br/>\nFrom: The Assynt Report &lt;assyntreport@assynt.com&gt;    <br/>\nDate: 23/02/2022 18:02 (GMT+01:00)    <br/>\nTo: EEAS OSI IAP CONTAINER &lt;OSI-IAP-CONTAINER@eeas.europa.eu&gt;    <br/>\nSubject: Assynt Report Daily Digest    <br/>\n<br/>   <br/>\n<a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#bbbfc3; font-size:19px; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none\"><img alt=\"Assynt Report Portal\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/email-logo.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; border:none; max-width:200px\"/></a>          <br/>\n<img alt=\"Assynt Report Portal\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/email-header-image.jpg\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; max-width:100%; display:block\"/>                <br/>\n              <br/>\n\nAssynt Report Daily Digest                <br/>\n<p color=\"white\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px; color:white\">\n23 February 2022</p>              <br/>\n\nMiddle East                  <br/>\n \nIran                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nKhamenei&apos;s call for &apos;hybrid warfare&apos; does not signal likely rise in attacks and will chiefly aim to deter Israeli offensives amid JCPOA progress\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nIsraeli sabotage attacks on nuclear sites remain likely, alongside attacks on shipping and cyberattacks intended to inflict economic damage\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nIran will retaliate, including via Hizballah, but will prioritise deniable operations to avoid jeopardising progress towards sanctions easing\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30497\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n\nIraq                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nSupreme Court ruling against KRG&apos;s oil and gas law unlikely to jeopardise oil contracts as Baghdad will remain keen to retain revenue\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nUnstable regulatory environment will not undermine extractives investment in KRG given region&apos;s strong supply links to European oil markets\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nKirkuk will face slightly elevated risk of sporadic violence following ruling, with PMUs potentially seeking to increase presence around oilfields\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30502\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n                 <br/>\n\nAfrica                  <br/>\n \nLibya                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nHoR&apos;s appointment of prime minister-designate will increase pressure on GNU and raise risk of clashes upon cabinet&apos;s formation\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nBashagha will struggle to gain significant support from hardline western militias as he seeks to establish himself as credible leader\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nClashes, including between rival Tripoli-based militias, will not trigger wider escalation, meaning collapse of ceasefire unlikely in coming months\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30501\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n                 <br/>\n\nAsia                  <br/>\n \nIndonesia                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nPurchase of French and US jets will raise prospect of wider defence deals with Western governments over coming years\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nJakarta will continue efforts to expand maritime and aerial capabilities to secure its borders over coming years\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nChina&apos;s importance to Jokowi&apos;s economic agenda, as well as limited overlap between maritime claims will limit prospect of major security escalation\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30498\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n\nPhilippines                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nMilitary-NPA clashes in south will increase ahead of election as insurgents seek to strengthen position ahead of likely resumption of talks\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nAttacks will remain concentrated in south and will target security forces and government interests, posing little direct threat to businesses\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nNew president will likely seek to re-engage rebels in peace talks but will prioritise economic recovery, making ceasefire this year unlikely\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30500\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n\nChina                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nBeijing will exploit Ukraine crisis to step up provocations regarding Taiwan and gauge US response over coming weeks\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nFrequency of incursions likely to spike during live-fire Taiwanese drills on islands near Chinese mainland next month\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nLikelihood of invasion of Taiwan over coming year remains low given President Xi&apos;s focus on domestic agenda\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30504\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n                 <br/>\n\nLatin America                  <br/>\n \nBrazil                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nBolsonaro&apos;s meeting with Putin will be popular with his core supporters but will alienate floating voters\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nLimited Brazil-Russia trade means US-led sanctions on Moscow will have little direct economic impact\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nLeft-wing and centrist rivals will use meeting to win over centrist voters and increase poll lead\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30499\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n\nMexico - Government will step up its attempts to control lithium extraction                   <br/>\n <ul style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.4; text-align:justify; font-size:14px; padding-left:0; margin-bottom:32px\"><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nGovernment will step up its attempts to control lithium extraction </li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nRising resource nationalism will create significant uncertainty for private sector\n</li><li style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749; margin-left:0; list-style:none; margin-bottom:16px\">\nAmbiguous policies will deter investment and stall Mexico&apos;s attempts to become electric vehicle hub\n</li></ul><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; text-align:left; margin-bottom:24px\"><a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/app/report/30503\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px; text-transform:uppercase; padding:8px 16px; color:#fff; display:inline-block; text-decoration:none; background-color:#1e8749; text-align:center; width:100%\">View\n full report </a></p>                  <br/>\n                 <br/>\n<p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#333333; font-size:16px; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:24px; text-align:center\">\nHave a question? <br/><a href=\"mailto:assyntreport@assynt.com\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\">assyntreport@assynt.com</a></p>                 <br/>\n\nThis content is provided on a confidential basis and for the sole use of the Client. Distribution in part or in whole outside the Client&apos;s organisation is prohibited. For further information, please email us at\n<a href=\"mailto:assyntreport@assynt.com\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\">\nassyntreport@assynt.com</a>  or call +44 (0) 20 7856 9450                   <br/>\n                <br/>\n              <br/>\n          <br/>\nOn social media? We are too:\nDownload our apps:\n                   <br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/assynt\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\"><img alt=\"LinkedIn\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/linkedin-in.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; max-width:100%; display:block; width:35px; height:35px; padding:4px; border:1px solid #999\"/></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/assyntgroup\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\"><img alt=\"Twitter\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/twitter.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; max-width:100%; display:block; width:35px; height:35px; padding:4px; border:1px solid #999\"/></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkdwxaz-by5z2zMvj6Fg7ZQ\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\"><img alt=\"YouTube\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/youtube.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; max-width:100%; display:block; width:35px; height:35px; padding:4px; border:1px solid #999\"/></a>                       <br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.appstore.com/AssyntReport\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\"><img alt=\"Download on the App Store\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/email-app-store.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; border:none; display:block; height:35px; width:auto; max-width:none\"/></a><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.falanx.assyntreport\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\"><img alt=\"Android App on Google Play\" src=\"https://d1lhjlv9hfha7x.cloudfront.net/email-play-store.png\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; border:none; display:block; height:35px; width:auto; max-width:none\"/></a>                       <br/>\n                   <br/>\n<p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:24px; color:#aeaeae; font-size:12px; text-align:center\">\nThis email was sent to you because you are subscribed to the Assynt Report. <br/>\nYou can change your <a href=\"https://assyntreport.com/\" style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1e8749\">\nsubscription settings</a> anytime.</p><p style=\"font-family:helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.5em; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:24px; color:#aeaeae; font-size:12px; text-align:center\">\n 2022 Assynt Report Portal. All rights reserved.</p>                <br/>\n              <br/>\n          <br/>\n      <br/>\n   <br/>\n</body></html>"
  },
